A UI mockup of a modern music player app in landscape orientation on a smartphone, designed as a desk or tabletop display. 16:9 screen, dark theme with a deep navy-to-purple gradient background and soft neon glow accents in cyan and magenta.

Left half: a large square album art with rounded corners and a soft shadow, with a slowly rotating vinyl record peeking out from behind it. Below it, the song title in bold white sans-serif type and the artist name in lighter gray.

Right half: a clean playback panel. At the top, a glowing audio waveform visualizer with smooth animated bars. In the middle, a thin seek bar with the elapsed time on the left and total time on the right, with a glowing circular progress knob. Below that, large circular control buttons: shuffle, previous, a big central play/pause button with a gradient fill, next, and repeat. At the bottom, a volume slider and a small "Up Next" queue showing three upcoming songs as slim cards.

Style: glassmorphism cards with frosted blur, rounded corners, generous spacing, minimal and premium, high contrast, large touch-friendly buttons readable from a distance. Flat vector UI, crisp, high resolution, shown as a straight-on screenshot with no phone frame.
